Audio Duration: 2m 48.3s (168.31s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:22:28 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 12 | Text: 人最不能相信的就是忠诚的两个字
Segment #2   [00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,200] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 12 | Text: 只有没有选择的人才存在所有的忠诚
Segment #3   [00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,260] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 11 | Text: 没有任何人会永远忠诚于谁
Segment #4   [00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,480] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 11 | Text: 他所有的忠诚只不过是能够
Segment #5   [00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,000] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 11 | Text: 基于他的既得利益的角度下
Segment #6   [00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,460] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 9  | Text: 我身边就经常有人跟我说
Segment #7   [00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,340] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 10 | Text: 哎呀背叛我的人不得好死
Segment #8   [00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,160] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 2  | Text: 怎么样怎么样
Segment #9   [00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,280] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 但我觉得这个东西
Segment #10  [00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,820] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个世界上就没有背叛了这不是
Segment #11  [00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,160] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 留下一个女人
Segment #12  [00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,140] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 她遇到了一个男人
Segment #13  [00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,040] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 能够对她更好
Segment #14  [00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,160] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 给她更好未来的时候
Segment #15  [00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:23,020] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 10 | Text: 那余胜她跟对方在一起了
Segment #16  [00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,180] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 这是所谓的背叛吗
Segment #17  [00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:24,600] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 1  | Text: 不是
Segment #18  [00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,860] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 这是人往高手足
Segment #19  [00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:26,580] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 水往低处流
Segment #20  [00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,380] | Elapsed:  16.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 这是自然法则
Segment #21  [00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,700] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 这是这个世界的规律
Segment #22  [00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,500] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 不叫背叛
Segment #23  [00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,660] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 11 | Text: 她只是一个选择了更适合自己的人
Segment #24  [00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,020] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 对自己更好的男人
Segment #25  [00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:33,820] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以说有些时候
Segment #26  [00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:35,200] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 大家所认为的忠诚
Segment #27  [00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,920] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 只是没有更好的选择而已
Segment #28  [00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:37,860] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 5  | Text: 换个意思来说
Segment #29  [00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,220] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是无所谓忠诚
Segment #30  [00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,820] | Elapsed:  40.13s | Words: 11 | Text: 忠诚是因为背叛的充满不够
Segment #31  [00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:41,740] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 与人像一个男人
Segment #32  [00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,900] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 她的本性是什么
Segment #33  [00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,620] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 她肯定花心
Segment #34  [00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,840] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 她见一个爱一个
Segment #35  [00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:47,560] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 她是永远不可能只忠于一个
Segment #36  [00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,900] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 已经到处的女人
Segment #37  [00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:49,960] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说在这个世界上
Segment #38  [00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,400] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 能让男人唯一忠诚的
Segment #39  [00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,400] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是权利和价值
Segment #40  [00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,380] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 要么就是利益
Segment #41  [00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,280] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 你能让一个男人
Segment #42  [00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,400] | Elapsed:  40.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 永远不可能背叛你
Segment #43  [00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,540] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 尤其只有一个可能
Segment #44  [00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:59,960] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 12 | Text: 就是他选择背叛你的代价太大了
Segment #45  [00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,020] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是他所能接受的
Segment #46  [00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,740] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 11 | Text: 可能很多人不认可我说的这个话
Segment #47  [00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:03,380] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是我还是
Segment #48  [00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:04,260] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 我还得说
Segment #49  [00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,340] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 8  | Text: 人性的底色就是背叛
Segment #50  [00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,560] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 12 | Text: 无论你对一个人曾经有多么好
Segment #51  [00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,240] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 有多么爱他
Segment #52  [00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:09,920] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 该离开的时候
Segment #53  [00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,700] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 他还是会离开
Segment #54  [00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,060] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 但不影响我们爱他
Segment #55  [00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:13,160] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 结果我们掌控不了
Segment #56  [00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:15,080] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 11 | Text: 但是我们可以掌握中间的这个过程
Segment #57  [00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:16,520] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 人活着注定会死
Segment #58  [00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,000] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 10 | Text: 那我们何必会再以结果呢
Segment #59  [00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:18,920] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 爱了就是爱了
Segment #60  [00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,780] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 恨了就是恨了
Segment #61  [00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,040] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 开心过了就可以了
Segment #62  [00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,400] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 人生有三种经济
Segment #63  [00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,760] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 第一种是看山是山
Segment #64  [00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,420] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 看水是水
Segment #65  [00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:25,340] | Elapsed:  65.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 看见好人是好人
Segment #66  [00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:26,280] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 看见坏人是坏人
Segment #67  [00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,260] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 第二个阶段是
Segment #68  [00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,080] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 看山不是山
Segment #69  [00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:28,860] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 看水不是水
Segment #70  [00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:29,840] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 好人不像好人
Segment #71  [00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,000] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 他们坏人也不像坏人
Segment #72  [00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,420] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 就不敢倾一下定论了
Segment #73  [00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,340] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 第三个阶段
Segment #74  [00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,560] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是看山还是山
Segment #75  [00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,480] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 看水还是水
Segment #76  [00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,540] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是我无所谓了
Segment #77  [00:01:36,540 --> 00:01:37,460] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为我不在乎
Segment #78  [00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,420] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 你爱不爱我
Segment #79  [00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:39,580] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 你跟我没有任何的关系
Segment #80  [00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:40,460] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 我不需要任何人
Segment #81  [00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:41,560] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 我一样可以活得很好
Segment #82  [00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,860] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是所有的东西
Segment #83  [00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:43,680] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 我可以向内求
Segment #84  [00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,440] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 我也不相信所有的众统和背叛
Segment #85  [00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:46,420] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 我只认我自己
Segment #86  [00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:48,280] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 12 | Text: 人这辈子或许会被很多人背叛
Segment #87  [00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,440] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 但那又如何呢
Segment #88  [00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,440] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 12 | Text: 这些人不就是注定来成就你的吗
Segment #89  [00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,420] | Elapsed:  86.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 不经力磨难
Segment #90  [00:01:52,420 --> 00:01:53,340] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 怎么能见彩虹
Segment #91  [00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:54,960] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就包括像在市面上
Segment #92  [00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,440] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 8  | Text: 所有的情感大师教你
Segment #93  [00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,800] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 怎么样挽回一个男人
Segment #94  [00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,220] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 怎么样能让女人死因塌地
Segment #95  [00:01:59,220 --> 00:01:59,760] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你们
Segment #96  [00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,660] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们教的都不对
Segment #97  [00:02:00,660 --> 00:02:01,860] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 8  | Text: 我是情感导师的别主
Segment #98  [00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:02,920] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就记住了
Segment #99  [00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,420] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 10 | Text: 无论男性情感女性情感
Segment #100 [00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:05,400] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 核心就一句话
Segment #101 [00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,020] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 10 | Text: 当你不再在乎任何人的时候
Segment #102 [00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:07,800] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就天下无敌
Segment #103 [00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:09,220] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 7  | Text: 你只要有那个念想
Segment #104 [00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:10,640] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 10 | Text: 你学太多专业类的东西
Segment #105 [00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,560] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 你还是被人拿捏
Segment #106 [00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,260] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 3  | Text: 因为你有爱
Segment #107 [00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,480] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 4  | Text: 高手是什么
Segment #108 [00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,400] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 4  | Text: 是无情的
Segment #109 [00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,540] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 你只要没有情的那一刻
Segment #110 [00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:16,940] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 你就不会有任何的情感问题
Segment #111 [00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,140] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 在这个社会上
Segment #112 [00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:18,940] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 靠山山会倒
Segment #113 [00:02:18,940 --> 00:02:19,800] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 靠人人会跑
Segment #114 [00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,000] | Elapsed: 106.92s | Words: 3  | Text: 只有靠自己
Segment #115 [00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:23,540] | Elapsed: 125.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 只有靠你独立的钱
Segment #116 [00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:25,040] | Elapsed: 125.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 你没过情观的钱
Segment #117 [00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:25,700] | Elapsed: 125.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 你是搞不到钱
Segment #118 [00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:26,780] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 最后一句话送给你们
Segment #119 [00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:27,340] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 你们戏评
Segment #120 [00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:28,720] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 我要再讲第二遍
Segment #121 [00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,940] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么要讲第二遍
Segment #122 [00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:30,700] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 因为重复
Segment #123 [00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:31,840] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 你才能记得足够情
Segment #124 [00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,820] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 永远永远不要谈恋爱
Segment #125 [00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:35,820] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 永远永远不要爱上别人
Segment #126 [00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:37,500] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 永远不要吃爱情的苦
Segment #127 [00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:39,220] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 你赚不到钱的本质原因
Segment #128 [00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:40,680] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是因为你们有过情观
Segment #129 [00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,220] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 你把所有有限的时间经历
Segment #130 [00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,200] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 全部放在了
Segment #131 [00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,600] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 高男人高女人身上
Segment #132 [00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,380] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 我说的对还是不对
Segment #133 [00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,680] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 家人不识人
Segment #134 [00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,880] | Elapsed: 125.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
